{"2841710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vermin", "steam_appid": 2841710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vermin is a first-person survival horror game about hunting, feeding the heart, and dreaming of death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything suffers- even the trees in the forest moan in pain, it's almost as if they too, have lost everything. Though you're no better than whatever caused this. <strong>Do you still think the animal in your trap doesn't suffer, even after hearing it's screams?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEED THE HEART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the heart each day with the creatures that you hunt, and use them to mutate your body, explore new areas, and find new items, and maybe then..<strong> it will set you free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAP AND HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps, find creatures to hunt, <strong>and defend yourself if you have to...</strong> In this brutal world, sometimes your best option is to run, if you can't run, hide, and if you can't hide.. don't bother praying, God isn't listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/05e33493dfebeb3d5f92b264192e7499.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your small inventory and use your precious items sparingly, you never know when you will need them, <i>maybe it's better to save that shotgun shell for later.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to create something useful, or save them to make new traps or upgrades when you get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT AND EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this unforgiving world and feel the suffering through the thick, numbing atmosphere. Collect items, craft new traps, and catch new creatures in hopes of joining the others, <strong>in the dirt...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/7e006de4907ea723a936ee170ed6288a.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 unique areas to explore, all with their own creatures, obstacles and items, in a small open world, with metroidvania style progression, given by mutating your body from the creatures that you catch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRY NOT TO BLEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you bleed, the faster nightfall approaches. So be careful in the forest, watch your step, and take your time. The brutally dark Night brings terrors<strong>, and the heart will not let you sleep, until it is fed...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/574be1eed7b4dc7ad199822d47a96fef.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/574be1eed7b4dc7ad199822d47a96fef.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/574be1eed7b4dc7ad199822d47a96fef.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps and hunt creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is your most valuable resource</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self defence is a last resort</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutations help you explore new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors of the night will find you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade creatures for items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 unique areas in this small open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope for death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vermin is a first-person survival horror game about hunting, feeding the heart, and dreaming of death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/af3c11346a2b9fab93fb686c97875893.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything suffers- even the trees in the forest moan in pain, it's almost as if they too, have lost everything. Though you're no better than whatever caused this. <strong>Do you still think the animal in your trap doesn't suffer, even after hearing it's screams?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEED THE HEART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the heart each day with the creatures that you hunt, and use them to mutate your body, explore new areas, and find new items, and maybe then..<strong> it will set you free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/c461658947e1910143a3604f279c957b.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAP AND HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps, find creatures to hunt, <strong>and defend yourself if you have to...</strong> In this brutal world, sometimes your best option is to run, if you can't run, hide, and if you can't hide.. don't bother praying, God isn't listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/05e33493dfebeb3d5f92b264192e7499.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your small inventory and use your precious items sparingly, you never know when you will need them, <i>maybe it's better to save that shotgun shell for later.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/db3d473300c19307369467ad476202dd.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to create something useful, or save them to make new traps or upgrades when you get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.poster.avif?t=1773595732\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.webm?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/0edb1cff2db2a7a16934b45319fd504b.mp4?t=1773595732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT AND EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this unforgiving world and feel the suffering through the thick, numbing atmosphere. Collect items, craft new traps, and catch new creatures in hopes of joining the others, <strong>in the dirt...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841710/extras/7e006de4907ea723a936ee17